 "source_instruction": "i need a fashionable zdfer polo with a slim fit in the green color.",
 "query": "I swear my neighbor\u2019s golden retriever has been sneaking over to my backyard every single evening this week to steal the cherry tomatoes right off my patio planters, and yesterday I caught him red-pawed with three whole fruits squished in his jowls like he was hoarding fancy dog treats. I tried leaving a little bowl of cut-up apple slices out by the fence to distract him yesterday, but he just snubbed them entirely, trotted straight past, and went for the sun-warmed tomatoes like they were the fanciest gourmet snack on the planet. I even texted his owner to tease her about it, and she sent me a blurry photo of him passed out on her couch an hour later with tomato juice still smudged all over his white chest fur, looking totally unapologetic about the whole heist. It\u2019s gotten to the point where I\u2019m half-tempted to plant a whole separate tomato bed just for him next year, since he clearly thinks he\u2019s entitled to the entire harvest now. Hey there, I\u2019m browsing the men\u2019s henleys section right now and need one with that cool retro varsity patch design, slim fit, and the light option, plus it has to come with a matching woven cotton wristband for me to toss in my gym bag. Oh right, I can\u2019t spend more than $20 on it total, so don\u2019t pull anything over that price point for me, yeah? I\u2019m grabbing it to wear to a casual friend\u2019s cookout this weekend so I don\u2019t want anything too baggy or overpriced.",
